      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "Every variant call ([iVar](https://andersen-lab.github.io/ivar/html/) by default) with its [snpEff](https://pcingola.github.io/SnpEff/) effect, one row per sample and mutation. A call at an allele frequency of 0.75 or more enters the consensus. Pick a dot or a table row to open that position in the genome browser, which opens on the best supported call (the highest allele frequency, then depth, intergenic calls last); the left panel narrows the calls by gene, effect and support.\n",
